# Every Dockerfile here builds from the repository root (`docker build -f <path>/Dockerfile .`),
# so this file decides what enters every build context. Secrets never do: an operator's
# apps/norn-cell-rivet/.env, and any other env, key or credential file, stays on the machine.
**/.env
**/.env.*
**/*.env
!**/env.example
**/*.pem
**/*.key
**/*.p12
**/*.pfx
**/id_rsa*
**/id_ed25519*
**/.npmrc
**/.netrc
**/.pypirc
**/credentials.json
**/service-account-key.json
**/bitwarden*.json
**/.aws
**/.docker
**/.ssh
# Large and machine-local: history, build output, installed dependencies.
.git
**/target
**/node_modules
